Package: libarrow2500
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Apache Arrow columnar arrays and IPC library
 Apache Arrow provides columnar data structures and interoperable tools for
 analytical data processing. This package contains the shared C++ library
 for columnar arrays and IPC.

